        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:2px solid #28193e;box-shadow:0 26px 70px #05031155;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#21172e\">\n<header style=\"background:#141021;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:2cqw 4.5cqw\"><strong style=\"color:#ffda56;font-size:1.6cqw;letter-spacing:.18em\">TWILITE</strong><nav style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2cqw;font:700 1.4cqw system-ui\"><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/library/root.node\" style=\"color:#eee;text-decoration:none\">Library</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/root.node\" style=\"color:#eee;text-decoration:none\">The Twilite Zone</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/library/starters/start-with-your-ai/root.node\" style=\"background:#ffd64b;color:#201329;padding:.9cqw 1.8cqw;border-radius:.7cqw;text-decoration:none\">Start free ↗</a></nav></header>\n<section style=\"padding:5cqw;background:#36107a;color:white\"><div style=\"font:850 1.4cqw;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#ffd64b\">YOUR IDEAS · YOUR AI · YOUR WORK</div><h1 style=\"font:550 7cqw/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:1.5cqw 0 2cqw;letter-spacing:-.02em\">Build with your AI.<br>Keep what you create.</h1><p style=\"font:430 2.2cqw/1.48 system-ui;max-width:63ch;color:#efe7ff;margin:0 0 2.3cqw\">Turn ideas, plans, and projects into connected graphs you can revisit, change, and share. See the whole project. Zoom into any part. Keep building after the conversation ends.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/library/starters/start-with-your-ai/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:#ffd64b;color:#24163b;border:1px solid #ffd64b;border-radius:1cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;font:800 1.7cqw system-ui\">Start with your AI</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/products/twilite/pages-and-nodes/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:#ffffff17;color:white;border:1px solid #c3b4e5;border-radius:1cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;font:800 1.7cqw system-ui\">Why nodes instead of pages? ↗</a></div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);align-items:end;gap:1.6cqw;margin-top:4cqw\">\n<div><div style=\"background:#ffda56;color:#512b7f;display:grid;place-items:center;height:8cqw;border-radius:1cqw;font:800 4cqw Georgia,serif\">K</div><small>GLYPH</small></div>\n<div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:white;color:#24152d;height:12cqw;padding:1.8cqw;border-radius:1cqw\"><small style=\"color:#784cb7\">GOAL</small><div style=\"font:600 2.1cqw Georgia,serif;margin-top:1cqw\">Launch my project</div></div><small>SUMMARY</small></div>\n<div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:white;color:#24152d;height:15cqw;padding:1.8cqw;border-radius:1cqw\"><small style=\"color:#784cb7\">GOAL · IN PROGRESS</small><div style=\"font:600 2cqw Georgia,serif;margin-top:1cqw\">Launch my project</div><div style=\"font:500 1.35cqw system-ui;color:#7a7181;margin-top:1cqw\">3 tasks · 1 question<br>Change a piece, not the whole page</div></div><small>DETAIL</small></div>\n<div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:white;color:#24152d;height:18cqw;padding:1.8cqw;border-radius:1cqw\"><small style=\"color:#784cb7\">GOAL · IN PROGRESS</small><div style=\"font:600 2cqw Georgia,serif;margin-top:1cqw\">Launch my project</div><div style=\"font:500 1.35cqw system-ui;color:#7a7181;margin-top:1.5cqw\">Tasks · Notes · Questions<br>Open the parts around it</div><div style=\"background:#281834;color:white;padding:1cqw;margin-top:1.5cqw;font:650 1.3cqw system-ui\">Your working context</div></div><small>IN CONTEXT</small></div>\n</div></section>\n<section style=\"padding:4.2cqw 5cqw 3.5cqw\"><div style=\"font:850 1.3cqw;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7441a7\">WHAT YOU GET</div><h2 style=\"font:550 4.6cqw/1.13 Georgia,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 2cqw\">Your work doesn't disappear<br>when the conversation ends.</h2><p style=\"font:430 1.9cqw/1.55;color:#57505f;max-width:74ch\">Twilite gives your ideas a home outside the chat: pieces with identities, saved relationships, and a workspace you can return to tomorrow. You can browse a complete project or focus on one node.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:3cqw;margin-top:3cqw;border-top:1px solid #e4dce9;padding-top:2.6cqw\">\n<div><strong style=\"color:#7144a3;font-size:1.3cqw\">YOURS</strong><h3 style=\"font:550 2.2cqw Georgia,serif\">A file you own</h3><p style=\"font:430 1.6cqw/1.5;color:#615b69\">Save portable .node files, including to your own GitHub repository.</p></div>\n<div><strong style=\"color:#7144a3;font-size:1.3cqw\">ANY AI</strong><h3 style=\"font:550 2.2cqw Georgia,serif\">Bring your collaborator</h3><p style=\"font:430 1.6cqw/1.5;color:#615b69\">Work with an AI that follows Twilite's authoring contract, not one exclusive assistant.</p></div>\n<div><strong style=\"color:#7144a3;font-size:1.3cqw\">CONNECTED</strong><h3 style=\"font:550 2.2cqw Georgia,serif\">Keep the relationships</h3><p style=\"font:430 1.6cqw/1.5;color:#615b69\">Explore connected ideas spatially or consume another graph's exposed views.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"padding:4cqw 5cqw;background:#f7f4fc;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:4cqw;align-items:center\"><div><strong style=\"color:#7548a4;font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:.1em\">UNDER THE HOOD</strong><h2 style=\"font:550 3.5cqw/1.14 Georgia,serif\">One file. More than one view.</h2><p style=\"font:440 1.8cqw/1.5;color:#5b5266\">A graph is structured JSON that both you and your AI can read and write. Keep the underlying nodes and edges, and present them as pages, cards, or a navigable network.</p><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/products/twilite/pages-and-nodes/root.node\" style=\"font:800 1.7cqw;color:#693d9e\">Explore pages versus nodes ↗</a></div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:#14111e;color:#e4d6fb;border-radius:1cqw;padding:2.3cqw;margin:0;font:500 1.5cqw/1.55 ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">{\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"label\": \"Collect the quotes\",\n  \"data\": { \"status\": \"todo\" }\n}</pre></section>\n<section style=\"padding:4cqw 5cqw\"><strong style=\"font-size:1.3cqw;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7548a4\">PROOF, NOT JUST PROMISES</strong><h2 style=\"font:550 3.7cqw/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0 2.2cqw\">See the real thing.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.8cqw\"><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/how-it-works/root.node\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;padding:2.1cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2d9ed;border-top:.45cqw solid #7445b7;border-radius:1cqw;color:#29203a;text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"font:850 1.2cqw;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#7749a7\">HOW IT WORKS</div><div style=\"font:580 2.4cqw/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0\">From node to destination</div><div style=\"font:460 1.6cqw/1.45 system-ui;color:#655b6e\">Real classes, semantic edges and a graph-built boutique.</div><div style=\"font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#7749a7;margin-top:1.5cqw\">Explore ↗</div></a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/products/twilite/pages-and-nodes/root.node\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;padding:2.1cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2d9ed;border-top:.45cqw solid #7445b7;border-radius:1cqw;color:#29203a;text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"font:850 1.2cqw;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#7749a7\">PAGES AND NODES</div><div style=\"font:580 2.4cqw/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0\">Why use a graph?</div><div style=\"font:460 1.6cqw/1.45 system-ui;color:#655b6e\">Compare linear pages, spatial structures and remote consumption.</div><div style=\"font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#7749a7;margin-top:1.5cqw\">Explore ↗</div></a><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/blusheree/root.node\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;padding:2.1cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2d9ed;border-top:.45cqw solid #7445b7;border-radius:1cqw;color:#29203a;text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"font:850 1.2cqw;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#7749a7\">BLUSHEREE</div><div style=\"font:580 2.4cqw/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0\">Visit a real place</div><div style=\"font:460 1.6cqw/1.45 system-ui;color:#655b6e\">See a published storefront created as a Twilite graph.</div><div style=\"font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#7749a7;margin-top:1.5cqw\">Explore ↗</div></a></div></section>\n<section style=\"padding:4cqw 5cqw;background:#f1edfa\"><strong style=\"font-size:1.3cqw;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7144a3\">CHOOSE YOUR WAY IN</strong><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.1cqw;margin-top:2cqw\">\n<div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #c9c0d3;border-radius:1cqw;padding:2.6cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><strong style=\"font:850 1.3cqw;color:#7441a7\">FREE</strong><h3 style=\"font:550 3.1cqw Georgia,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0\">Explore the Zone.</h3><p style=\"font:450 1.75cqw/1.65;color:#5b5464\">Visit public graphs<br>Browse the Library<br>Follow tutorials<br>Get started with your AI</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto\"><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/root.node\" style=\"font:800 1.7cqw;color:#693d9e\">Explore free ↗</a></div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#17111d;border-radius:1cqw;color:white;padding:2.6cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><strong style=\"font:850 1.3cqw;color:#ffda56\">THE EDITOR · 14 DAYS FREE, THEN $20/MONTH</strong><h3 style=\"font:550 3.1cqw Georgia,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0\">Keep it. Build on it.</h3><p style=\"font:450 1.75cqw/1.65;color:#eee7f3\">Save to a file or GitHub<br>Work across multiple graphs<br>Use your own AI agent<br>Publish what you make</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto\"><a href=\"https://twilite.zone/?get-editor=1\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:#ffd64b;color:#24163b;border:1px solid #ffd64b;border-radius:1cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;font:800 1.7cqw system-ui\">Open live Editor offer ↗</a></div></div></div></section>\n<footer style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;padding:2cqw 5cqw;background:#234177;color:white;font:700 1.4cqw system-ui\"><a style=\"color:white;text-decoration:none\" href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/library/root.node\">The Library</a><a style=\"color:white;text-decoration:none\" href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/root.node\">The Twilite Zone</a><span>Twilite LLC</span><a style=\"color:#ffda56;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://twilite.zone/?get-editor=1\">Sign in</a></footer></div>"
        },
